firstPdfT -- forms step 4, the first PDF (Tony, 2026-11-08). openPDF(pdfReq) opens a PDF context at the request's path,
its page the request's width and height (copied from firstLight's own), and puts it in the top's pointer slot as
makeDisplay does a bitmap, handing it down; drawWalk then draws exactly as it draws into the bitmap, opening no bitmap of
its own because the top already holds a context; closePDF(pdfReq) ends the page and closes the file. readPDF(pdfRead)
draws page 1 into a bitmap on pdfRead, so pixelAt reads it. The file goes to IncantForms/PDF/output.pdf, gitignored,
overwritten each run (Tony, R1); formsPop deletes it before the run, so a stale file cannot pass.
Rows (genLadder/formsPop.sh): the file exists and begins %PDF; readPDF reports 1 page of 400x200 (firstLight's frame);
PD-1 to PD-4 read the page back at today's bitmap rows' coordinates, the fills, ok's border, heading's line and the
right way up. H7 (the walk skipped between open and close): the file rows hold, the page reads blank.
